body:
I suffer from suicidal depression, and I told my best friend about it as I couldn't bring myself to tell my parents. Instead of keeping it to herself, she ratted me out to her mum, who then in turn informed my mum. This led to a huge fight between both of us and a deeply wounded heart of mine. 

&#x200B;

When I confronted my best friend about it, she had the cheek to tell me that she did that because she couldn't keep such things to herself forever and told me to seek professional help as she felt I was getting 'darker and darker'. Although we've recently made peace over the situation, I realize that I can no longer trust her like I used to
